{"data":{"body":"[P2] Handle delete-start failures per stack\n\nIf any `delete-stack` call fails, `execFileSync` throws outside a catch, aborting the sweep before later stacks are processed or existing deletions are awaited. One undeletable stack therefore prevents cleanup of unrelated closed PRs. Catch and collect deletion-start failures per stack, continue processing the others, and report aggregate failures after waiting for successfully started deletions.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABD6kXyw","finding_digest":"a0a92b2446540dda447a2b538e08503aa1c5d3f857e701c291535dda44439054","finding_id":"arf_v1_ucuswjcgkqg5urd2fnjy4ccqhk","finding_key":"integration-test/cleanup-pr-stacks.mjs::delete-stack-loop::one-failure-aborts-sweep","identity_key":"integration-test/cleanup-pr-stacks.mjs::delete-stack-loop::one-failure-aborts-sweep","line":129,"observation_digest":"bda8a0dfe0d08091088cd8aeab8f6bd0b9557dba5f0376b3c2ccd58722390cc5","observation_id":"aro_v1_xwukbx7a2cajccem3cxkxd3l2c","path":".github/workflows/scripts/integration-test/cleanup-pr-stacks.mjs","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ucuswjcgkqg5urd2fnjy4ccqhk","published_at":"2026-11-12T23:28:41Z","review_id":"arr_v1_f3px7zerddysc3jxak6zaakgii","reviewed_base_sha":"48173acd2de943ce5fb43de8dd3683b9bcf8ab50","reviewed_head_sha":"7d6c839fe1129488bbb8a7e24d06a6d790294bc2","reviewer":"codex","start_line":127,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":1222},"record_id":"art_v1_5jd7yrka2uefbhiuwhbdv2tgko","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-12T23:28:41Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
